    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but i gotta be honest, some of the directors are really pushing back on this. they think focusing on \"social\" or \"environmental\" stuff is just a distraction from our fiduciary duty to maximize returns for shareholders. they're worried it's just performative and could actually hurt our bottom line in the short term. how should i address those specific concerns?",
